      en: ["The Storforsen rapids drop a total of 82 meters over a 5 km stretch.", "Maximum water flow during the spring can reach up to 870 m³/s.", "It is the most visited natural attraction in the Norrbotten province.", "The rapids never freeze due to the high kinetic energy of the flow.", "Rare orchids, such as the Lady's Slipper, thrive in the nature reserve.", "The area was officially designated as a nature reserve in 1968."],
